    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The last two years of medical school are when students face important choices about their career. The majority of students choose to pursue a specialised field of medicine but even though Taha Sabri, MBBS '14, was keen on a clinical career in psychiatry, he ended up making a very unconventional choice.",
